{"id":"662231","name":"花蛤蒸蛋","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/662231/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"2个"},{"name":"花蛤","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"花蛤泡水里，加一勺盐吐吐沙。","img":"images/662231/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"烧开水，下入花蛤烫开。","img":"images/662231/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冲洗掉里面的泥沙。","img":"images/662231/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"花蛤控干水分，摆在盘里。","img":"images/662231/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"打两个鸡蛋。","img":"images/662231/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加入1.5倍水，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/662231/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"将蛋液倒进花蛤盘中，过滤掉泡沫。","img":"images/662231/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"封上保鲜膜，开水锅中蒸10分钟。","img":"images/662231/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"酱油比较咸，加点温开水稀释一下。","img":"images/662231/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"将酱油汁倒入盘中，撒上小葱花。细嫩鲜香。","img":"images/662231/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}